figdown 0.1 bitfield
# 0.1: the comment scanner honours the string escapes the tokenizer
# honours (\n \" \\). Before the fix it toggled its in-quote state on the
# ESCAPED quote below, read the following `#` as a comment introducer, cut
# the line there and reported `unterminated string` for a legal document.
title "a \" b # c"
bitfield x "X" numbering=msb0
field "one" 8 description="a \" # b"
field "two" 8 description="ends with a backslash \\"
